From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: preserve offloaded AP VLAN interfaces

Add an opt-in AP VLAN offload contract, preserve VLAN identity through all
transmit paths, and notify the authenticator once for authorized 4addr RX.
Recreate VLANs and bind their peers after security is restored. Restore
station 4addr capability when the firmware peer is recreated.
Drivers which do not opt in retain the existing AP VLAN behavior.

Merged from:
  QSDK R50 0063-003-ath11k-add-AP_VLAN-vif-support-for-WDS-offload-in-NSS-offload.patch
    [PATCH 3/3] ath11k: add AP_VLAN vif support for WDS offload in NSS offload
  QSDK R50 0128-ath11k-fix-support-for-ext-vdev-in-NSS-for-AP_VLAN-v.patch
    [PATCH] ath11k: fix support for ext vdev in NSS for AP_VLAN vif during recovery
  QSDK R50 0067-002-ath11k-add-dynamic-VLAN-support-in-NSS-offload.patch
    [PATCH 3/3] ath11k: add dynamic VLAN support in NSS offload

Signed-off-by: Sathishkumar Muruganandam <murugana@codeaurora.org>
